<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="4f294d34">&lt;p&gt;
    The team summarizes what went well in the engagement and identifies areas that need improvement from a team perspective
    regarding delivery of service to the client, team interaction, coordination, etc. This step gives valuable input into
    optimization of future engagements. On an individual level, it may help identify input for their personal development
    plan for the year.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Note: In some situations, the Lessons Learned discussion may include client personnel. As such, internal EY content
    should be addressed separately.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
