<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="ebbd9d71"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="8743deaf">This work product contains detailed notes on areas for project improvement as well as issue resolutions and how to
avoid them in the future. All learning from the project is documented in this log. Provides a structured method to capture
project team insight. Often the insight of the person performing the work provides the best source for improvement ideas</attribute>
